      "text": "PAGASA issues a Heavy Rainfall Warning for Habagat and LPA in the following areas as of 5 a.m., June 8, 2025:\n\n🟠 ORANGE WARNING\n• Metro Manila\n• Bulacan\n• Rizal\n• northern and central Quezon\n• Laguna\n• Batangas\n• Cavite\n\n🟡 YELLOW WARNING\n• Zambales\n• Bataan\n• Tarlac\n• Pampanga\n• Nueva Ecija\n• rest of Quezon\n• northern Occidental Mindoro\n• northern Palawan\n\n⚠️ The threat of flooding and landslides remains in these areas.\n\n#WeatherPatrol | via @arielrojasPH",
